# Rust / slurm-broker
# Cargo.lock is committed (reproducibility). Vendored crates + the crates-io->
# vendor redirect are a LOCAL offline-build convenience only (`cargo vendor`),
# never released. Releases ship prebuilt per-arch binaries (build-release.sh),
# like seccomp-wrapper/seccomp-wrapper-*.
slurm-broker/broker/target/
slurm-broker/vendor/
slurm-broker/broker/.cargo/config.toml
